  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "三次審査……無事、通過したぞ！\r\nよかったな、千雪！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はぁ～……よかった……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふ……\r\nとても嬉しいです。よかった……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も同じ気持ちだよ\r\nあと少し。この調子で頑張ろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050040",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私、この結果のこと……\r\n誰よりも、プロデューサーさんにお礼を言いたいです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺に……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい。私がいちばん悩んでた時\r\nいつも迷わず応援して、背中を押してくれましたから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、そんなのは当然だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "なんだ、じゃないです",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私、本当に、プロデューサーさんに出会えて\r\nよかったって思ってるんですから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050080",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、すまん\r\n俺もそう思ってるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪に出会って、声をかけて……ほんとによかった\r\nありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "は、はい……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ところで、それ、何なんだ？\r\n手に持ってるの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あ……これは、\r\nお守りのかわりです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "何か、手に持ってないと不安で",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050110",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\n何をお守りがわりにしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "いつもアイドル衣装でつけている髪飾りです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんにも褒めてもらったし、\r\n私の転機にもなった大事なものなので……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだったなぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい。この髪飾りには、\r\n最後の舞台まで一緒に来てもらうことにします",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600105/7016001050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001050150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "最後まで、あの時の自分と頑張るために",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
